d 'COINTVOL': module to evaluate Cointegration under volatility and heteroskedasticity
d
d	cointvol collects in one package the econometric methods
d for cointegration when the innovations are conditionally   
d heteroskedastic (ARCH/GARCH), have nonstationary volatility
d (variance breaks, trending or stochastic volatility), or are	 
d heteroskedastic in other ways. The methods are implemented from
d the original papers. Each help file maps every computational	 
d step to the equation of its source and labels each option
d "Original" or "Extended implementation". 
d
d KW: cointegration
d KW: ARCH volatility
d KW: heteroskedasticity
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260926
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f cointvol.ado
